// A Transfer is permitted iff its amount is under 100 AND the same user
// logged in within the last 30 minutes. The `&&` conjoins a native Cedar
// comparison with a `temporal { … }` monitor *in the same expression* —
// the composition the pre-Slice-1 (whole-clause-marker) surface could
// not express. cedarify hoists the temporal conjunct to a
// `context.__temporal_0` boolean and leaves the `amount < 100` comparison
// as native Cedar.
permit (
    principal,
    action == Drupe::Action::"Transfer",
    resource
)
when {
    context.input.amount < 100
    && temporal {
        formerly within 30m Drupe::Action::"Login"::request{ input.user: context.input.user }
    }
};
